Abode
Copyright 2026 Abode contributors

This product is a derivative work of Watchbear (https://github.com/halitsever/watchbear),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications made to the original work:
  - Removed the Google OAuth sign-in requirement and all associated auth code,
    so the product requires no accounts.
  - Replaced the NestJS + Socket.IO + TypeORM/Postgres room server with a
    Cloudflare Worker + Durable Object relay over plain WebSocket.
  - Refactored the single-file content script into a platform adapter layer.
  - Added a host-only playback control lock.
  - Added clock-offset estimation and soft drift correction to playback sync.
  - Added per-address connection limiting and raised the invite code's entropy,
    since with no accounts the link is the only credential.
  - Redesigned the user interface and rebranded from Watchbear to Abode.
